DESCRIPTION >
    Edge-case check: count of events with a UTM source but no AI source (any
    event type). Tenant-scoped; prunes via site_id (this query has no
    timestamp predicate — preserved exactly from source). Faithful 1:1 port of
    api/routes/events.js:322-330 (queryName 'edge_utm_no_ai'). Typed-column
    translation: properties.site_id -> site_id, properties.utm_source ->
    utm_source (typed, Nullable per §2.6), properties.ai_source -> ai_source
    (typed, LowCardinality Nullable per §2.6). No JSON-bag fields.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

TOKEN "st_endpoint_read" READ

NODE edge_utm_no_ai_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT count() AS cnt
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND utm_source IS NOT NULL
      AND utm_source != ''
      AND (ai_source IS NULL OR ai_source = '')

TYPE endpoint
